719 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 457 0 R
/E (Lord, I confess the moments when I have made money my god without realizing it. The moments when I checked my account before I talked to You. The moments when I let my financial situation determine my mood, my faith, and my sense of security. Forgive me for placing my trust in things that are subject to change when You are the only constant I will ever need. I lay down the weight of financial anxiety at the foot of Your throne and I ask You to take it from me completely.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
720 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 457 0 R
/E (I surrender every dollar, every debt, every dream tied to money, and every financial decision I am currently facing to Your authority. I ask You to take over. Order my steps. Align my decisions. Close doors that are not for me and open the ones that are. Let every financial move I make from this day forward be Spirit-led, not fear-driven. Let wisdom, not desperation, guide every choice I make in this season and every season ahead.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
