<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 464 0 R
/E (Expand my capacity, Father. Let my financial containers be enlarged so that what You pour in does not spill out from mismanagement or immaturity. Let my faith be enlarged so that I am not surprised when the overflow comes. Let my generosity be enlarged so that overflow does not make me selfish but makes me a greater blessing to the world around me. I am positioned. I am ready. I am expecting You to do exactly what You said. In Jesus' name, Amen.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
