<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 468 0 R
/E (But Lord, I also ask You today to begin opening the right doors. The doors that are aligned with Your plan for my financial life. The doors I have not thought to knock on yet. The doors that are waiting on the other side of a step of obedience I have not taken. The doors that require a level of faith I am still growing into. Prepare me for them, Father. Expand my vision so that I can see the opportunities You have placed around me. Give me the boldness to knock, the patience to wait, and the discernment to recognize the right door when it opens.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
