<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 471 0 R
/E (Lord, let this business be a vehicle for my purpose, not just my income. Let it solve real problems for real people in a way that honors You and reflects Your excellence. Give me wisdom in my strategy, creativity in my content, and anointing in everything I produce. Let the people who come in contact with my brand be better for it. And let the financial breakthrough I am asking for be a direct result of the value I am providing and the God who is blessing it. In Jesus' name, Amen.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
