790 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 472 0 R
/E (Search my relationships, Lord. Are there connections in my life that are financially draining me or spiritually blocking me? People who are speaking lack and limitation over my life? Partners or associations that are pulling me away from the financial path You have designed? Give me the wisdom and the courage to create healthy boundaries or to release what needs to be released so that nothing I am holding onto becomes an obstacle to what You are trying to bring in.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
