>>
endobj
793 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 473 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
794 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 473 0 R
/E (I come against every demonic assignment that has been sent to steal, kill, and destroy my financial progress. Every assignment designed to cause deals to fall through at the last minute. Every assignment designed to create unexpected expenses that drain what I have worked to save. Every assignment designed to bring confusion, distraction, and miscommunication into my financial dealings. I bind every one of those assignments in the name of Jesus and I declare them null and void. What God has blessed, the enemy does not have the authority to curse, and my finances are blessed.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
795 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 473 0 R
/E (I also come against the spirit of self-sabotage that has sometimes led me to make decisions that undermine my own financial progress. The impulse spending that wipes out savings. The avoidance that keeps me from looking at my numbers until the situation is critical. The fear of success that quietly causes me to shrink when I should be expanding. The procrastination that delays income-producing actions until opportunities pass. I renounce every one of these patterns and I ask You to replace them with discipline, wisdom, and the courage to consistently choose my future over my impulses.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
