/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 478 0 R
/E (Lord, I come before You today asking You to expand my financial imagination. I have been operating within a limited understanding of how money can flow into my life, and I ask You today to show me new income streams that I have not yet explored. Open my eyes to opportunities I have been overlooking. Remind me of skills and gifts I have been underestimating. Bring to the surface ideas that have been buried under busyness, doubt, or a lack of confidence in my own ability to execute them.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
