/E <>
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
821 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 478 0 R
/E (And as You show me the new streams, give me the boldness to pursue them without waiting for perfect conditions. Give me the willingness to start small and grow faithfully. Let me not be paralyzed by the fear of failure or the fear of judgment. Let me move with the quiet confidence of someone who knows that the God who gave them the idea will also back the execution. New income is on its way. I receive it with open hands and a ready spirit. In Jesus' name, Amen.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
