<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 479 0 R
/E (Meet this specific need, Father. You know the amount. You know the deadline. You know the weight I am carrying and the anxiety that comes with not knowing how it will be resolved. You see it all and You are not alarmed. You are not scrambling. You are not trying to figure out how to help me. You already have the answer, the provision, and the pathway prepared. I am simply asking You to release what You have already prepared and let it reach me in time.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
826 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 479 0 R
/E (And in this moment of need, let my faith not waver. Let me not spiral into fear or take matters into my own hands in ways that create new problems while solving the old one. Let me trust You fully, act wisely, and watch You move on my behalf. You have never failed me yet, and You are not starting today. Supernatural supply is on its way, and I receive it by faith before I see it with my eyes. In Jesus' name, Amen.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
