924 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 499 0 R
/E (Father, I want to experience the kind of favor that shows up in places I was not looking for it. The kind of divine appointment that happens at a coffee shop, in a grocery store, in a random conversation with a stranger who turns out to be connected to exactly the person I needed to meet. The DM from someone I do not know that turns into a life-changing business relationship. The phone call from a number I almost did not answer that completely changes the trajectory of my financial life.)
/Pg 59 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
925 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 499 0 R
/E (You are the God of divine appointments, and I want to be fully alert and fully available for every one of them. Let me not be so buried in my head, so consumed by my schedule, so fixated on my to-do list that I miss the moment of favor that You arranged specifically for me. Let me be present enough to notice what is happening around me. Let me be discerning enough to recognize a divine setup when it is in front of me. Let me be bold enough to engage rather than walk past what You have positioned in my path.)
/Pg 59 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
