935 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 501 0 R
/E (Teach me how to live as a favored person in a consistent, sustainable way. Teach me the practices and postures that keep me in alignment with the lifestyle of favor Your Word promises. Let me be a person who tithes faithfully. A person who gives generously. A person who treats others with the honor and respect that reflects the God I serve. A person who maintains integrity when it would be easier to cut corners. A person who serves with excellence even when no one is watching. Let these practices become so natural and consistent in my life that favor becomes my inevitable daily experience.)
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [2]
>>
