<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 503 0 R
/E (I choose obedience today, Father. I choose to honor You with my tithe. I choose to listen for and follow Your Spirit's leading in my business and my financial decisions. I choose integrity in every transaction, transparency in every agreement, and faithfulness in every commitment I make. I choose to give generously even when I want to hold tightly. I choose Your ways over my own clever strategies. I am positioning myself for chasing blessings by walking in comprehensive obedience to Your Word.)
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [2]
>>
