<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 506 0 R
/E (Father, I lay my business before You completely and I ask for Your blessing to rest on it from the foundation to the ceiling. You know this business better than I do. You know why I started it, what it costs me, what it means to me, and what potential it has to serve people and generate the income that funds my purpose. You know its weaknesses and its strengths. And I am asking You today to take everything I have built and bless it in ways that go far beyond what I could achieve through strategy alone.)
/Pg 66 0 R
/K [1]
>>
