<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 511 0 R
/E (Bless my discernment. Let me have the mental and spiritual acuity to distinguish between good opportunities and great ones. Between people who are genuine allies and people who are distractions or dangers. Between my own good ideas and the God-breathed ones that carry a different quality of anointing and potential. Discernment in a world of abundant choices is one of the most valuable mental gifts I could have, and I ask for it freely today.)
/Pg 71 0 R
/K [3]
>>
