997 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 513 0 R
/E (And yet, Your Word promises that obedience brings blessing. Deuteronomy 28 is clear. Malachi 3 is clear. Proverbs 3 is clear. Obedience and blessing are connected in Your economy, and I stand on that connection with faith today. I trust Your Word. I trust that the seeds of obedience I have sown in my life are seeds that will produce a harvest in Your perfect time. I trust that nothing I have given, surrendered, or sacrificed in obedience to You will go unrewarded by a God who is faithful to every promise.)
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [3]
>>
