1000 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 514 0 R
/E (Father, I bless this morning before I look at a single number, before I check a single notification, before I open a single email or piece of news. I bless this day. I consecrate it to You. I declare that this morning is already good because You are already in it, and everything that happens within it will be filtered through the hands of a God who loves me and has good plans for my day. I refuse to begin from a place of anxiety, scarcity, or overwhelm. I begin from a place of blessing.)
/Pg 74 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
