1048 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 523 0 R
/E (Let me also be guided to new income-producing activities that I have not yet considered. Show me the skills I already have that I have been giving away for free that could be packaged and sold. Show me the knowledge in my head that could become a course, a book, a consulting service, or a digital product that generates revenue consistently. Show me the gaps in the market that my unique combination of gifts, experiences, and perspective is perfectly suited to fill. Multiply my income by multiplying my awareness of the opportunities You have already placed around me.)
/Pg 83 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1049 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 523 0 R
/E (And as my income multiplies, let my wisdom multiply with it. Let me never reach a financial level that I am not spiritually and mentally prepared to sustain. Multiply the income and the character simultaneously, so that the multiplication is permanent rather than temporary. In Jesus' name, Amen.)
/Pg 83 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
