/P 524 0 R
/E (Let every person I teach go on to teach others. Let every person I inspire turn around and inspire someone who would not have been reached without them. Let every product that creates transformation in one person's life be shared with someone else who needs the same transformation. Let the ripple effect of my work go so far beyond my direct reach that I will never know in this lifetime the full scope of what You used me to do. That is the multiplication of impact I am praying for.)
/Pg 84 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1053 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 524 0 R
/E (Give me the clarity to stay focused on my true calling rather than chasing every shiny opportunity that promises influence. Impact without intentionality is noise. Let me be strategic about where I put my best energy so that the seeds I plant are in the right soil and produce the right fruit. Let me serve the specific people I was called to serve with such excellence and specificity that the impact I have in that focused area is more powerful than a diluted impact spread over everything.)
/Pg 84 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
