/E (Show me where my stewardship needs improvement. Are there areas where I am spending without intention? Areas where I could be saving more aggressively? Areas where I have been investing too conservatively or too recklessly? Areas where my giving has become routine and formulaic rather than faith-filled and generous? Reveal the gaps in my stewardship with grace, and give me the practical tools and the willpower to close them one by one.)
/Pg 99 0 R
/K [3]
>>
