/P 543 0 R
/E (Lord, Your Word says that a good person leaves an inheritance for their children's children. I am praying to be that person. I am praying to build that inheritance. Let every financial decision I make contribute to a legacy that blesses my bloodline for generations. Let me build real estate, savings, businesses, and wisdom that can be passed down in ways that give the next generation a head start rather than requiring them to start from scratch.)
/Pg 103 0 R
/K [1]
>>
