<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 545 0 R
/E (And let my trust in You be so evident in uncertain seasons that it becomes a testimony to everyone watching my life. Let people see someone who is not rattled by economic news, who is not derailed by financial challenges, and who navigates uncertainty with a peace and a confidence that can only be explained by a genuine relationship with the God who holds every season in His hands. In Jesus' name, Amen.)
