1162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 546 0 R
/E (Let self-control in the area of finances become as natural for me as breathing. Let me rewire my relationship with money so that I make decisions from my values and my goals rather than from my emotions and my impulses. Let me be someone who pauses before every significant purchase and asks, "Is this aligned with where I am going? Is this a need or a want? Is this what I would choose if I were thinking about my future self?" Let that pause become a habit that protects my financial progress every single day.)
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 546 0 R
/E (Show me the specific areas where my financial discipline needs the most work. Maybe it is a subscription I keep forgetting to cancel. Maybe it is a pattern of retail therapy when I am stressed. Maybe it is a resistance to looking at my bank statements because I am afraid of what I will see. Whatever the weak spots are, reveal them to me gently and give me the practical tools and the spiritual willpower to address them one by one.)
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
