<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 552 0 R
/E (Thank You for every seed of obedience You have honored. For every tithe You have multiplied. For every act of giving that You rewarded with supernatural return. For every time I stepped out in faith and You showed up exactly when I needed You. For every morning I woke up to provision I did not manufacture. For every unexpected check, every surprise opportunity, every connection that came out of nowhere. All of it was You. Every single bit of it. And I am grateful from the depths of my heart.)
/Pg 112 0 R
/K [2]
>>
